{
  "sn44.3:0.1": "Linked Discourses 44.3 ",
  "sn44.3:0.2": "1. The Undeclared Points ",
  "sn44.3:0.3": "With Sāriputta and Koṭṭhita (1st) ",
  "sn44.3:1.1": "At one time Venerable Sāriputta and Venerable Mahākoṭṭhita were staying near Varanasi in the deer park at Isipatana. ",
  "sn44.3:1.2": "Then in the late afternoon, Venerable Mahākoṭṭhita came out of retreat, went to Venerable Sāriputta, and exchanged greetings with him. ",
  "sn44.3:1.3": "When the greetings and polite conversation were over, he sat down to one side, and said to Sāriputta: ",
  "sn44.3:2.1": "“Reverend Sāriputta, does a realized one still exist after death?” ",
  "sn44.3:2.2": "“Reverend, this has not been declared by the Buddha.” ",
  "sn44.3:2.3": "",
  "sn44.3:2.4": "“Well then, does a realized one no longer exist after death? … ",
  "sn44.3:2.5": "",
  "sn44.3:2.6": "",
  "sn44.3:2.7": "Does a realized one both still exist and no longer exist after death? … ",
  "sn44.3:2.8": "",
  "sn44.3:2.9": "",
  "sn44.3:2.10": "Does a realized one neither still exist nor no longer exist after death?” ",
  "sn44.3:2.11": "“This too has not been declared by the Buddha.” ",
  "sn44.3:2.12": "",
  "sn44.3:3.1": "“Reverend, when asked these questions, you say that they have not been declared by the Buddha. ",
  "sn44.3:3.2": "",
  "sn44.3:3.3": "",
  "sn44.3:3.4": "",
  "sn44.3:3.5": "",
  "sn44.3:3.6": "What’s the cause, what’s the reason why they have not been declared by the Buddha?” ",
  "sn44.3:4